{
  "info": {
    "name": "tn5250j Swing Debug API",
    "description": "Localhost HTTP API exposed by the tn5250j Swing desktop when launched with `--debug-interface` (`-A`).\n\n**Prerequisites**\n```bash\nmvn -Pshaded package\n\njava -jar tn5250j/target/tn5250j-0-SNAPSHOT.jar \\\n  --debug-interface \\\n  --debug-bind 127.0.0.1 \\\n  --debug-port 5036 \\\n  --debug-token agent-secret \\\n  --session \"Production\"\n```\n\n**Security**\n- Binds to `127.0.0.1` by default — do not expose on a network interface.\n- Set `--debug-token` in shared environments. Without a token, any local process can control open sessions.\n- Auth: `Authorization: Bearer <token>` or `X-Debug-Token: <token>`.\n\n**Agent workflow**\n1. `GET /v1/sessions` — pick target session id\n2. `GET /v1/sessions/{id}/screen` — read screen snapshot\n3. `POST .../input/text` or `POST .../input/keys` — enter data or press keys\n4. `POST .../input/mouse` — focus a field by position when needed\n5. Repeat from step 2\n\nSee [DEBUG-INTERFACE.md](../DEBUG-INTERFACE.md) for full documentation.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://127.0.0.1:5036",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "debugToken",
      "value": "agent-secret",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "sessionId",
      "value": "0",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{debugToken}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Discovery",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Service discovery",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": [""]
            },
            "description": "Returns service metadata and endpoint paths.\n\n**Response `200`:**\n```json\n{\n  \"name\": \"tn5250j-swing-debug\",\n  \"version\": 1,\n  \"health\": \"/health\",\n  \"sessions\": \"/v1/sessions\"\n}\n```"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Health check",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/health",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["health"]
            },
            "description": "Liveness check.\n\n**Response `200`:**\n```json\n{\"ok\": true}\n```"
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ],
      "description": "Service discovery and liveness endpoints."
    },
    {
      "name": "Sessions",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "List sessions",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/sessions",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["v1", "sessions"]
            },
            "description": "List open Swing session tabs in display order.\n\n**Response `200`:**\n```json\n[\n  {\"id\": 0, \"name\": \"Production\", \"connected\": true},\n  {\"id\": 1, \"name\": \"Test\", \"connected\": false}\n]\n```\n\n| Field | Meaning |\n|-------|---------|\n| `id` | Session index used by other endpoints |\n| `name` | Session name / tab label |\n| `connected` | Whether the session is connected to IBM i |"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Get screen snapshot",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/sessions/{{sessionId}}/screen",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["v1", "sessions", "{{sessionId}}", "screen"]
            },
            "description": "Returns logical screen state (`render`) plus the painted Swing raster layer (`painted`) sampled from the off-screen buffer.\n\n**Response `200`:**\n```json\n{\n  \"id\": 0,\n  \"rows\": 24,\n  \"cols\": 80,\n  \"cursorRow\": 6,\n  \"cursorCol\": 57,\n  \"cursorVisible\": true,\n  \"text\": \"Sign On\\n...\",\n  \"render\": { \"cursor\": \"000000001\", \"...\": \"...\" },\n  \"painted\": {\n    \"cursor\": \"000001001\",\n    \"differsFromRender\": \"000001000\",\n    \"foreground\": [\"green\"],\n    \"background\": [\"black\"]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n`painted.cursor` reflects XOR cursor lines actually in the raster (including ghost cursors). Use `?include=raster` for base64 PNG, `?include=planes` for 5250 planes, `?include=no-painted` to omit the paint layer."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Get screen snapshot (with planes)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/sessions/{{sessionId}}/screen?include=planes",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["v1", "sessions", "{{sessionId}}", "screen"],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "include",
                  "value": "planes"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Same as **Get screen snapshot**, plus base64-encoded raw plane buffers (`text`, `attr`, `isAttr`, `color`, `extended`, `graphic`, `field`) for low-level debugging."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ],
      "description": "Session listing and screen state."
    },
    {
      "name": "Input",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Send keys",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"keys\": \"[enter]\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/sessions/{{sessionId}}/input/keys",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["v1", "sessions", "{{sessionId}}", "input", "keys"]
            },
            "description": "Send key mnemonics through the same path as the on-screen keypad.\n\n**Examples:** `[enter]`, `[tab]`, `[pf3]`, `[pf12]`, `[help]`, `[roll up]`\n\n**Response `200`:** `{\"ok\": true}`"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Send text",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"text\": \"USER01\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/sessions/{{sessionId}}/input/text",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["v1", "sessions", "{{sessionId}}", "input", "text"]
            },
            "description": "Type literal text into the current field (uses paste/field input, not individual key events).\n\n**Response `200`:** `{\"ok\": true}`"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Mouse click (screen coordinates)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"row\": 12,\n  \"col\": 5,\n  \"clicks\": 1,\n  \"button\": 1\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/sessions/{{sessionId}}/input/mouse",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["v1", "sessions", "{{sessionId}}", "input", "mouse"]
            },
            "description": "Simulate a mouse click using **1-based** screen cell coordinates.\n\n| Field | Default | Meaning |\n|-------|---------|---------|\n| `row`, `col` | — | **1-based** screen cell |\n| `clicks` | `1` | Click count (`2` = double-click) |\n| `button` | `1` | `1` = left, `3` = right |\n\n**Response `200`:** `{\"ok\": true}`"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Mouse click (pixel coordinates)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"x\": 120,\n  \"y\": 180,\n  \"clicks\": 1,\n  \"button\": 1\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/sessions/{{sessionId}}/input/mouse",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["v1", "sessions", "{{sessionId}}", "input", "mouse"]
            },
            "description": "Simulate a mouse click using pixel coordinates within the session panel.\n\n| Field | Default | Meaning |\n|-------|---------|---------|\n| `x`, `y` | — | Pixel coordinates within the session panel |\n| `clicks` | `1` | Click count (`2` = double-click) |\n| `button` | `1` | `1` = left, `3` = right |\n\n**Response `200`:** `{\"ok\": true}`"
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ],
      "description": "Keyboard and mouse input for a session."
    },
    {
      "name": "Examples",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Sign-on flow",
          "item": [
            {
              "name": "1. Read screen",
              "request": {
                "method": "GET",
                "header": [],
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/sessions/{{sessionId}}/screen",
                  "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
                  "path": ["v1", "sessions", "{{sessionId}}", "screen"]
                },
                "description": "Inspect the sign-on screen before entering credentials."
              },
              "response": []
            },
            {
              "name": "2. Enter user",
              "request": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [
                  {
                    "key": "Content-Type",
                    "value": "application/json"
                  }
                ],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"text\": \"USER01\"\n}",
                  "options": {
                    "raw": {
                      "language": "json"
                    }
                  }
                },
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/sessions/{{sessionId}}/input/text",
                  "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
                  "path": ["v1", "sessions", "{{sessionId}}", "input", "text"]
                },
                "description": "Type the user id into the current field."
              },
              "response": []
            },
            {
              "name": "3. Tab to password",
              "request": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [
                  {
                    "key": "Content-Type",
                    "value": "application/json"
                  }
                ],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"keys\": \"[tab]\"\n}",
                  "options": {
                    "raw": {
                      "language": "json"
                    }
                  }
                },
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/sessions/{{sessionId}}/input/keys",
                  "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
                  "path": ["v1", "sessions", "{{sessionId}}", "input", "keys"]
                },
                "description": "Move to the password field."
              },
              "response": []
            },
            {
              "name": "4. Enter password",
              "request": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [
                  {
                    "key": "Content-Type",
                    "value": "application/json"
                  }
                ],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"text\": \"SECRETPWD\"\n}",
                  "options": {
                    "raw": {
                      "language": "json"
                    }
                  }
                },
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/sessions/{{sessionId}}/input/text",
                  "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
                  "path": ["v1", "sessions", "{{sessionId}}", "input", "text"]
                },
                "description": "Type the password into the current field."
              },
              "response": []
            },
            {
              "name": "5. Submit",
              "request": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [
                  {
                    "key": "Content-Type",
                    "value": "application/json"
                  }
                ],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"keys\": \"[enter]\"\n}",
                  "options": {
                    "raw": {
                      "language": "json"
                    }
                  }
                },
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/sessions/{{sessionId}}/input/keys",
                  "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
                  "path": ["v1", "sessions", "{{sessionId}}", "input", "keys"]
                },
                "description": "Press Enter to submit sign-on."
              },
              "response": []
            },
            {
              "name": "6. Read screen after sign-on",
              "request": {
                "method": "GET",
                "header": [],
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/sessions/{{sessionId}}/screen",
                  "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
                  "path": ["v1", "sessions", "{{sessionId}}", "screen"]
                },
                "description": "Verify the post sign-on screen."
              },
              "response": []
            }
          ],
          "description": "Example agent workflow for IBM i sign-on. Run requests in order after starting the desktop with `--debug-interface`."
        }
      ],
      "description": "End-to-end example flows."
    }
  ]
}
